    "notes": [
      "Specialty daylight cafe. Service bar is the focal point: modeled L counter, back-bar, espresso return, order end, stools.",
      "Window reading nook is a raised bay on the left wall. Chairs face the table; the room-side chair also faces the glass. Seating is chairs and bar stools.",
      "Atrium lantern over the centre table. Guest circulation runs from the entrance runner to the order end, then to stools, tables, or the nook step."
    ]
